OL,3,GNEWSACQC finds 'shortfalls' in snap
OL,4,Ahospital inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health watchdog said it had found
OL,7,F"significant shortfalls in the standard
OL,8,Fof care" at a hospital during an
OL,9,Funannounced inspection.
OL,11,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Fvisited The Queen Elizabeth Hospital
OL,13,F(QEH) in King's Lynn amid concerns
OL,14,Faround "emerging risk" and the time
OL,15,Fsince the last assessment.
OL,17,FQEH spokeswoman Jo Segasby said: "This
OL,18,Freport contains serious findings and we
OL,19,Ffully accept them, including the
OL,20,Fwarning notices issued by the Care
OL,21,FQuality Commission."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
