OL,3,GNEWSACQC finds 'shortfalls' in snap
OL,4,Ahospital inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Ivory-Donnelly, CQC deputy
OL,7,Fdirector of hospitals in the East of
OL,8,FEngland, said inspectors had found a
OL,9,Fdecline in "safety and quality of
OL,10,Fcare".
